_count": 3, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 213], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "8e30b14c57389bc6fe7ec8a52eb0e46b419073f2138828d7a3f810c9da8e4bbe", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 100], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "872a52ec9ded3384277b00e7929fa9ddf79b724e9e7e02913ee7ef456b62e64f", "role": "user", "sequence": 4}, {"character_range": [0, 18], "next_role": null, "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "b37601beb467825a8df8b80d673cd7f23a86992c2e0d647e5636ea7c2473e31a", "role": "user", "sequence": 7}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "这道题我忘记了它这个切线方程怎么求了。\n\n首先这道题，x 对 t 的导数等于 e^t × cos t，y 对 t 的导数等于 2 × cos t - sin t，z 对 t 的导数等于 3 × e^(3t)，对吧？\n\n然后将 t = 0 代入，x 对 t 的导数在 0 点处就等于 1，y 对 t 的导数在 0 点处等于 2，z 对 t 的导数在 0 点处等于 3，得到 (1, 2, 3)。\n\n这道题我忘了切线方程怎么求？\n"}